<title>UK: German inland gas oil weak, demand thin.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil weak, demand thin.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.7140)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     32.20/32.60     18.78/19.02   32.60/32.80</p>
<p> BREMEN		32.20/32.60     18.78/19.02   32.60/32.80</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    32.30/32.70     18.84/19.08   32.90/33.10</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   33.00/33.40     19.25/19.49   33.60/33.80</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.10/33.50     19.31/19.54   33.70/33.90</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.10/34.50     19.89/20.12   34.50/34.90</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices continued to be marked lower as poor demand fueled stiff competition for business, Traders said buyers are waiting to see if there will be any further weakening in benchmark Rotterdam market prices before re-stocking.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7456</p>
